  {"squelch", "vel", "How much velocity changes the level. 0 plays every note the same."},
  {"squelch", "level", "Overall level."},
  {"squelch", "acc", "Written in the Acc column on a note's row: 1 accents that note, up to F for a stronger accent. Blank is no accent; it counts for that note only."},
  {"squelch", "sld", "Written in the Sld column on a note's row: 1 glides into this note from the one before without restarting the envelopes. Blank is no slide; it counts for that note only."},
  {"duette", "vco1wave", "Oscillator 1: saw, triangle or square."},
