  {"duette", "vco2shape", "Oscillator 2 shape, as for oscillator 1. On noise it darkens the colour."},
  {"duette", "mod", "off. sync: oscillator 2 restarts with oscillator 1, a tearing lead sound as 2 moves. ring: oscillator 2 is multiplied by oscillator 1, a metallic, bell-like tone."},
