  {"duette", "mix2", "Level of oscillator 2."},
  {"duette", "cutoff", "Where the low-pass filter sits before the envelope and LFO move it, in Hz."},
  {"duette", "res", "Resonance. Turned right up the filter rings by itself."},
  {"duette", "egtype", "A/D: a note is a blip, attack then decay, whatever the note length. A/G/D: the sound holds while the note is held, and decay is the release. gate: the level follows the note, the envelope only moves its target."},
